---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="burger-del-mes" class="px-5 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="spotlight-heading">
  <article class="reveal mx-auto grid max-w-7xl overflow-hidden border border-lime/35 bg-panel md:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr]">
    <div class="relative min-h-72 overflow-hidden md:min-h-[490px]">
      <picture>
        <source type="image/avif" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553979459-d2229ba7433a?fit=crop&w=720&q=72&fm=avif 720w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553979459-d2229ba7433a?fit=crop&w=1200&q=72&fm=avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 52vw" />
        <source type="image/webp" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553979459-d2229ba7433a?fit=crop&w=720&q=72&fm=webp 720w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553979459-d2229ba7433a?fit=crop&w=1200&q=72&fm=webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 52vw" />
        <img class="food-image absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553979459-d2229ba7433a?fit=crop&w=720&q=72&fm=webp" alt="Burger de temporada con queso fundido y cebolla caramelizada" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </picture>
      <span class="absolute left-4 top-4 bg-lime px-4 py-3 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-black">Edición limitada · mes actual</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-7 md:p-12">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-lime" data-i18n="spotlight.eyebrow">Selección del chef</p>
      <h2 id="spotlight-heading" class="display mt-4 text-4xl leading-[.9] md:text-6xl"><span data-i18n="spotlight.title">La Burger</span><br /><span class="text-lime" data-i18n="spotlight.month">del Mes.</span></h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/70" data-i18n="spotlight.description">Doble smash de vacuno, queso ahumado, cebolla confitada lentamente, pepinillo crujiente y nuestra salsa de temporada entre pan brioche tostado. Un equilibrio goloso entre humo, acidez y dulzor.</p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3"><span class="display text-3xl text-lime">12,90 €</span><span class="text-xs text-white/55 line-through">15,50 €</span><span class="border border-white/20 px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/70">Precio especial de demo</span></div>
      <button type="button" class="focus-ring mt-7 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 bg-lime px-6 py-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-black transition hover:scale-[1.02] hover:bg-white" data-add-to-cart data-product-id="burger-del-mes" data-product-name="Burger del Mes" data-i18n-product-name="spotlight.cartName" data-product-price="12.9"><span data-i18n="spotlight.add">Añadir la edición limitada</span><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></button>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[10px] leading-5 text-white/55" data-i18n="spotlight.disclaimer">Receta y precio de muestra. La disponibilidad de temporada es ilustrativa.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
